  (text "ASSEMBLY NOTES\n1. U3 SiT5155: water-soluble flux only. No no-clean flux.\n   No ultrasonic or megasonic cleaning (SiTime).\n2. Reflow: IPC/JEDEC J-STD-020 profile.\n3. J2 SMA (132134): hand-solder after reflow. J3-J10 SMP (SMP-MSSB-PCT):\n   insert loose, mate the SDRs, then solder from the back (self-align).\n4. Outputs: J3-J6 10 MHz ~ +7 dBm/50R, J7-J10 PPS 3.3 V CMOS."
